{"title":"Virikh","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 70 times (1.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>1,661</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>1,683</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>8,711</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>11,744</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>9,238</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>1,580</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>1,883</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>425</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>447</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>576</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game 